OL,3,GNEWSAWater station opens and bottles
OL,4,Adelivered in outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water company says it has opened a
OL,7,Fwater station and delivered bottled
OL,8,Fwater to vulnerable customers after a
OL,9,Floss of supply.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for South West Water
OL,12,Fsaid some customers in the
OL,13,FBuckfastleigh area were experiencing
OL,14,Flow water pressure and temporary loss
OL,15,Fof supply after "issues with equipment"
OL,16,Fat one of its treatment works.
OL,18,FThey said resolving the original issue
OL,19,Fhad lead to air pockets forming within
OL,20,Fthe network which had affected
OL,21,Fsupplies.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
