OL,3,GNEWSAWater station opens and bottles
OL,4,Adelivered in outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water a bottled water
OL,7,Fstation had been opened at 16:30 BST in
OL,8,FMeadowbrook Car Park in Dartington
OL,9,Funtil 22:00 GMT and water had been
OL,10,Fdelivered to vulnerable customers.
